# A Geological Survey (Bastok 1-2): section 1's and section 2's other checks, by two chars (Resonance current keeps RoV
# 1-1 out). Main, a level 10 Warrior of San d'Oria with no mission: Cleades: section 1 fails (not Bastok): his script's
# 1003. bob, a level 10 Warrior of Bastok with The Zeruhn Report current (a GM): Cleades: 1-2's section 1 fails (a
# current mission), its section 2 too (not 1-2); 1-1's own section answers (ORIGINAL_MISSION_OFFSET).
# Rival zone-ins, another mission's script: both chars' logins in Bastok Markets play Seekers of Adventure's Rumors from
# the West onZoneIn, which returns 22 each (no event packet; bob's login also writes his area 12 status 2).
lists BastokMarkets/Cleades/onTrigger
char zone=BastokMarkets pos=-358,-10,-168 job=WAR lvl=10 nation=0
char bob zone=BastokMarkets pos=-358,-10,-168 job=WAR lvl=10 nation=1
mission Rov Resonance current
bob: mission Rov Resonance current
bob: mission Bastok TheZeruhnReport current
login
trigger Cleades                         # not Bastok: no section: his script's 1003
finish
bob: login
bob: trigger Cleades                    # a current mission (1-1): 1-1's ORIGINAL_MISSION_OFFSET
